  "title": "Why Time in the Market Beats Timing the Market (The Actual Math)",
  "description": "The real reason \"time in the market\" works isn't magic - it's the shape of the compounding curve. We break down $10,000 growing at 7% a year over 40 years and show exactly why the last decade matters more than the first three combined.\n\nThis video uses AI-generated narration and visuals.\n\n#compoundinterest #investing #personalfinance",
