    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Now look at the dollar gain each decade. Years zero to ten added under ten thousand dollars. Years twenty to thirty added over thirty seven thousand. Nearly four times as much growth, from the exact same seven percent.",
      "slide": {
        "type": "bars",
        "headline": "Same 7%. Very different dollars.",
